          "title": "*",
          "content": "<p><em>一句话消息</em>*</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>- <a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/technology-54465361\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">美国陆军</a>为军犬配备了实验性的 AR 眼镜。行动过程中，指令会显示在眼镜上，远程指挥军犬的行动。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202011/bg2020111908.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202011/bg2020111909.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>- <a href=\"https://www.soyacincau.com/2020/11/18/kfc-autonomous-5g-restaurant-on-wheels-china/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上海张江</a>出现了无人餐车，扫码开门，取餐后会自动扣款，拿多少扣多少。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202011/bg2020111903.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202011/bg2020111904.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202011/bg2020111901.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202011/bg2020111902.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>- <a href=\"https://www.cnbc.com/2020/11/15/why-nasa-wants-to-put-a-nuclear-power-plant-on-the-moon.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">美国宇航局</a>计划2026年开始在月球上建设一座核电站。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202011/bg2020112101.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>- <a href=\"https://www.media.volvocars.com/global/en-gb/media/pressreleases/274379/watch-how-volvo-cars-drops-new-cars-from-30-metres-to-help-rescue-services-save-lives\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">瑞典沃尔沃汽车公司</a>使用起重机，将10辆汽车从30米高空自由下落，车头直接着地，测试极端情况下车辆的安全状况。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><img src=